{
  "slug": "toolkits-whatsapp",
  "title": "WhatsApp",
  "description": "Public support knowledge for WhatsApp.",
  "articlePath": "toolkits-whatsapp.md",
  "sources": [
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "WhatsApp toolkit supports WhatsApp Business API accounts, not personal WhatsApp accounts"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "WABA ID is required for WhatsApp connections"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "WhatsApp API key auth needs both system user token and WABA ID"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "WhatsApp OAuth2 initiation still requires `generic_id` as the WABA ID"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "WhatsApp OAuth requires a Meta developer app with Business use case enabled and published"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Meta OAuth errors can require adding the Composio redirect URI in the Meta app"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "WhatsApp template messages require an existing template before sending"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "`WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE` supports `components` in newer toolkit versions"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "When sending WhatsApp messages, pass real `phone_number_id` and `to_number` values"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Reading WhatsApp replies is better modeled as triggers/webhooks than a normal read API"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "Use Proxy Execute when a WhatsApp/Meta workflow needs direct provider API access with scoped credentials"
    },
    {
      "sourcePath": "toolkits/whatsapp/public.md",
      "sourceHeading": "WhatsApp Business app coexistence is enabled through Meta Embedded Signup"
    }
  ],
